- [x] "Test: reindex drops ephemeral, durable untouched" → Step 3
- [x] "Documentation: clear convention for new table additions" → Step 1 (the `TABLE_REGISTRY` const with `TablePartition` enum is self-documenting; every new table must be added to the registry with its partition type)
